      ],
      "text": "**For today, October 17: wear a well-fitting N95/KN95 if you’ll be outside for a while, but it’s generally not needed for a short commute.** Singapore’s forecast is **PSI 150–230 (unhealthy to very unhealthy)**. Cut back on strenuous outdoor activity, and check your area’s latest 1-hour PM2.5 reading in NEA’s myENV app before heading out. ([nea.gov.sg](https://www.nea.gov.sg/media/news/advisories/index/haze-situation-update-16-october-2026))\n\nIf you’re older, pregnant, a child, or have a heart or lung condition, minimize outdoor time today. ([nea.gov.sg](https://www.nea.gov.sg/media/news/advisories/index/haze-situation-update-16-october-2026))",
